<view class="page yc-page">
  <page-heading eyebrow="经营管理" title="新增返佣盘点" description="销量、返点与佣金逐项核对，后续调整保留更正记录。" /><view class="card hint">每个营业日、人员和游戏保留一条盘点。跨午夜仍归开店当天；后续调整使用留痕更正。销售额、返点和佣金分别核对填写，不自动计入门店资金盈亏。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="card">{{notice}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card">正在读取…</view><view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="card"><view>存在结果待核对的保存请求，已锁定新增。</view><button bindtap="retry" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">使用原请求重试</button></view><view wx:else class="card"><picker range="{{departments}}" range-key="name" value="{{deptIndex}}" bindchange="department" disabled="{{busy || loading}}"><view class="row">门店：{{deptIndex >= 0 ? departments[deptIndex].name : '请选择'}}</view></picker><view wx:if="{{day}}">营业日：{{day.businessDate}}</view><picker range="{{users}}" range-key="name" value="{{userIndex}}" data-kind="user" bindchange="select" disabled="{{busy || loading}}"><view class="row">盘点人：{{userIndex >= 0 ? users[userIndex].name : '请选择'}}</view></picker><picker range="{{games}}" range-key="name" value="{{gameIndex}}" data-kind="game" bindchange="select" disabled="{{busy || loading}}"><view class="row">游戏：{{gameIndex >= 0 ? games[gameIndex].name : '请选择'}}</view></picker><view>销售金额</view><input value="{{values.salesAmount}}" data-key="salesAmount" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}"/><view>返点（0至100，最多四位小数）</view><input value="{{values.rebate}}" data-key="rebate" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}"/><view>佣金</view><input value="{{values.commission}}" data-key="commission" bindinput="input" disabled="{{busy}}"/><view>记录说明（5至500字）</view><textarea value="{{values.reason}}" data-key="reason" bindinput="input" maxlength="500" disabled="{{busy}}"/><button type="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || loading || !day}}">保存并记录审计</button></view></view>
